    "额外用量": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Extra Usage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制网址": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy URL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "各台设备上对话进程的错误输出和 Claude Code 的调试日志。「连接」关着的不列。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Error output of conversation processes and Claude Code debug logs on each device. Devices with Connect off aren’t listed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关于": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关着时，回答里的网络图片要点一下才加载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, web images in replies load only after you tap them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
